# Git workflow

- Read AGENTS.md and relevant docs before each task.
- Fetch origin and start from latest origin/develop without discarding local work.
- Use feat/<feature-name>, fix/<issue-name>, or refactor/<scope>.
- Initial import uses chore/initial-import from develop.
- Never commit directly to main or develop.
- Make small commits and run relevant tests before an authorized push.
- Push only the current task branch; open a PR targeting develop.
- Never force-push shared branches or automatically merge.
- main merge and production deployment require explicit owner approval.
- Never change payment credentials without approval or commit secrets.
- Preserve the approved BuildNest UI.
